---
---

<section id="beneficios" class="pb-10 pt-14">
  <div class="wrap flex flex-col gap-7">
    <div data-reveal class="flex max-w-[640px] flex-col gap-2.5">
      <div class="eyebrow">BENEFICIOS</div>
      <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,4.4vw,2.6rem)] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.01em]">Menos sorpresas, más tranquilidad</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-[18px] [grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr))]">
      <div data-reveal data-zoom class="bn flex min-w-0 flex-col justify-between gap-2.5 border-copper bg-[#b5502e] text-white md:col-span-2" style="background:#b5502e">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" style="width:34px;height:34px"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9" /><path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0" /></svg>
        <h3 class="text-[28px] leading-[1.15]">Evita quedarte sin stock</h3>
        <p class="m-0 max-w-[420px] text-[17px] leading-[1.55] text-[#fbede6]">Alertas preventivas y críticas, con tiempo para pedir antes de que falte.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal style="--d:90ms" data-zoom class="bn">
        <span class="fi size-11 bg-ok-bg text-ok-fg"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" /><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" /><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" /><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" /></svg></span>
        <h3 class="mb-1.5 mt-3.5 text-[22px]">Para todo tu equipo</h3>
        <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-soft">Cada persona ve solo lo que necesita, según su rol.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal style="--d:140ms" data-zoom class="bn">
        <span class="fi size-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn-fg"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2" /><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2" /><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2" /><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2" /><path d="M7 12h10" /></svg></span>
        <h3 class="mb-1.5 mt-3.5 text-[22px]">Fácil desde el celular</h3>
        <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-soft">Registra movimientos escaneando, sin papeles.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal style="--d:60ms; background:#1e2a22" data-zoom class="bn flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-[18px] border-[#1e2a22] text-[#f6f1e7] md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex-[1_1_220px]">
          <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" style="width:32px;height:32px;color:#e07b55"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z" /><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" /></svg>
          <h3 class="mb-1.5 mt-3 text-[26px] leading-[1.15]">Tus datos, separados</h3>
          <p class="m-0 text-base leading-[1.55] text-[#c9d1cb]">Cada empresa tiene su información aislada y protegida.</p>
        </div>
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-20 items-end gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-[18px] rounded-md bg-[#e07b55]" style="height:40%"></span><span class="w-[18px] rounded-md bg-[#f6f1e7]" style="height:70%"></span><span class="w-[18px] rounded-md bg-[#e07b55]" style="height:55%"></span><span class="w-[18px] rounded-md bg-[#f6f1e7]" style="height:90%"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal style="--d:120ms" data-zoom class="bn flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-[18px] md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex-[1_1_220px]">
          <span class="fi size-11 bg-[var(--copper-soft)] text-copper-ink"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" /><path d="M14 2v6h6" /><path d="M8 13h8" /><path d="M8 17h8" /></svg></span>
          <h3 class="mb-1.5 mt-3.5 text-[22px]">Trae tu historial de Excel</h3>
          <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-soft">Sube un archivo Excel o CSV y Pango te guía para unir cada columna.</p>
        </div>
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold">
          <span class="rounded-lg bg-ok-bg px-3 py-1.5 text-ok-fg">ventas_2025.xlsx</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg bg-warn-bg px-3 py-1.5 text-warn-fg">inventario.csv</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
